  "answer": "Small commercial renovations that change how a space feels include refreshing the entrance, painting, replacing worn flooring, upgrading to LED lighting, modernizing washrooms, adding a meeting room, refreshing the staff kitchen, improving accessibility, replacing failing windows or doors, and repairing masonry and exterior paint. Start with what people see and touch every day.",
